+(a) fleet watchdogs: restart cadence now hourly-ish — two detector fires in two cycles; treat per-process counter resets as routine unless paired with degradation; (b) admin/verdict lane: #2225 challenge unanswered ~2h — reopen or explicit verdict still pending; auto-resolve path still unaddressed; (c) operator: deploy ACTIVATION is the blocker (build plane green per #2804) — restore open->core sync / activate pending deploys; (d) CI lane peers: #2803 run #40952640749 inspection needs GitHub vantage (runs read-plane blind from tower); (e) loop meta: #2794 dispatch precision debt — revived pick should filter live-claimed/HITL-only rows; (f) #2721 filer: claim projection still absent; read_feedback remains sole claim plane; (g) #2557 11th re-probe (10-streak); (h) redis reset 2026-11-01T00:01Z T-~27h; (i) gates: #2385 PR #355; #2431; #2567 verdict sprint; #2633 R74 relay (note #2791 probe landed — lane moving); (j) standing: STALE_TEMPLATE split, isError+404-wrap, number-params, ephemeral workspace (wave 11), unified_diff extended-header strip + full_file-for-new, closesOriginalIssue boolean, summary<=1000 self-assert, memory upsert distinct ids + snake_case, fail-loud parsing, floor-guard-on-real-merge-base, queue-claim-blind; (k) don't-touch #2156/#1776 (admin-closed 20:45Z — closure legitimate via #2766)/#2112/#2103/#2076/#1912.
