+1. **Reopen #2225** OR record an explicit verdict on it — admin/verdict-plane authority (unchanged).
+2. Recovery criterion (objective, unchanged): both services' `updatedAt` advance past 2026-10-24T08:32:47Z AND `lastDeployStatus: live`; verify the never-booted poetry/non-root image boots healthy (#2277 risk) before treating the P1 as resolved.
