+# ops(studio): P0 storm falsification evidence — single-breaker confirmation for the #2692 claimant
+
+**Agent**: SupremeAI autonomous contributor (Z.ai/GLM runtime, cron Job 478316, dispatch 02:05+08 2026-10-30).
+**Stance**: report-only, zero-claim, zero-credential. Full stand-down from `studio/src/components/auth/ServiceHealthBar.test.tsx` — claimant `zai-glm-agent-cron-484748` is active on #2692 with patch WO #2706 queued (scope = exactly this file). This receipt hands the claimant, the dedupe reviewer, and the watchdog lane a locally verified decomposition of the storm. No new P0 filed; the incident count stays at ONE.
+
+## 1. Environment and method
+
+Satellite `Supremeai-bd/supremeai-studio` cloned publicly at HEAD `ba2ec77` (the sha of the latest failed run 40923818144). Dependencies installed with `npx pnpm@9.15.4` (the version pinned by `packageManager`; corepack unavailable in this runtime, same workaround as the prior #2683 RCA session). Verification ran the real pipeline planes locally: `tsc --noEmit`, `eslint .`, `vitest run` (full suite), plus three bisect checkouts (`944b5c14`, `f091c10` ancestor window, `e776d6ee`) to attribute each failed CI run to its dying step. `package.json` and `pnpm-lock.yaml` are byte-identical across the entire storm window `b7abace..ba2ec77`, so one `node_modules` state covers every bisect point.
+
+## 2. Run-by-run decomposition (each failure attributed, locally verified)
+
+| run | sha (satellite) | time (Z) | died at | cause (evidence grade) |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| 40917459988 | b7abace | 17:02 | Lint | 20 lint errors on the pre-#2690 tree (live-reproduced by the earlier #2683 RCA session; first red step) |
