+| 40922682506 | f091c10 | 17:34 | Test | App.test palette assertion (ServiceHealthBar green at this sha — the alignment sync had landed; App.test bound below) |
+| 40923528903 | e776d6ee | 17:40 | Test | INVERTED PAIR: ServiceHealthBar.test asserts `Scraper Relay` while the component still renders `Scraper Service` (reproduced: 2 failed / 697 passed at this checkout) + App.test (heals at this same sha) |
